types of Linked List : 

1 : one way linked list 
2 : two way linked list 
3 : round way linked list 

* : round  way linked list is form off two linked list .

--
order's of one way linked list :

1- add : 

add to head : O(1)
add to tail : O(1)
add to body : O(n) 

2- delete : 

delete the head Node  : O(1) 
delete the tail Node : O(n)
delete a Node in middle : O(n) 

3- search :

finding a Node : O(n)

4- Move between the Node's : 

Moving between the Node's : O(n)

--
order's of two way linked list : 

1- add : 

add to head : O(1)
add to tail : O(1)
add to body : O(n) 

2- delete : 

delete the head Node  : O(1) 
delete the tail Node : O(1)
delete a Node in middle : O(n) 

3- search :

finding a Node : O(n)

4- Move between the Node's : 

Moving between the Node's : O(n)

--
* : because round way linked list is a form off a two way linked list the order's are same .


